    "text": "Delhi CM Rekha Gupta Hits Out at Congress Over ECI-SIR Row, says Opposition making False Allegations\nSep 27, 2026\nNew Delhi, September 27 (ANI): Delhi Chief Minister Rekha Gupta held a press conference and hit out at the Congress and opposition over the Election Commission's Special Intensive Revision (SIR) controversy. Gupta alleged that the opposition was making false allegations to distract people from development issues. She said elections were being conducted with full transparency and that all allegations were false. She also stated that decisions had been taken with the acceptance of all three Election Commissioners.",
    "summary": "Delhi CM Rekha Gupta Hits Out at Congress Over ECI-SIR Row, says Opposition making False Allegations New Delhi, September 27 (ANI): Delhi Chief Minister Rekha Gupta held a press conference and hit out at the Congress and opposition over the Election Commission's Special Intensive Revision (SIR) controversy. Gupta alleged that the opposition was making false allegations to distract people from development issues. She said elections were being conducted with full transparency and that all allegations were false. She also stated that decisions had been taken with the acceptance of all three Election Commissioners.",
